= Italy is intervening in Austrian Conflict!

As the conflict in Austria continues, we have started receiving reports that Italy has begun openly backing the Fatherland Front in Austria, strengthening them and their allies. If we desire the SDAPÖ to triumph, we will need to invest more resources in their struggle against the Austrofascists! 
